From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:38:15 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 56/61] Meridian: design pass fixes; profile windows swap
 without a blank frame

- Command bar: readable suggestions in the dark theme (Meridian's colours);
  pressing a Switch to Tab row keeps the field focused, so the rows don't
  jump and the click lands.
- Site Control Center closes when the sidebar hides or the peek ends.
- URL pill names browser pages (Workbench, Settings) and local files.
- About shows Meridian's version and the Chromium it is built on; the ad
  blocking hint points at the sliders in the address bar.
- Home: the developer card's button fits on one line.
- Theme editor: the focus ring uses the space colour.
- A space in another profile: its window shows behind the current one with
  no macOS animation and comes forward once painted.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
